---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="404 Not Found" description="The page could not be found.">
  <div class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col p-6 lg:p-12 font-sans overflow-hidden fade-up cute-dots">
    <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 lg:top-12 lg:left-12 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">小窝状态 🏡</span>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 lg:top-12 lg:right-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground">错误代码：404</span>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 lg:bottom-12 lg:left-12 z-20">
      <button
        onclick="history.back()"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/25 bg-background/70 px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        ← 返回上一页
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 lg:bottom-12 lg:right-12 z-20">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        回到首页 🏠
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center max-w-2xl mx-auto z-10 w-full text-center">
      <div class="text-6xl mb-6 animate-float select-none">🥺💦</div>
      <h1 class="text-[7rem] sm:text-[10rem] font-extrabold tracking-tighter cute-gradient-text leading-none mb-4 select-none">404</h1>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">页面跑丢啦！</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        你找的页面不存在、被搬走了，或者正在偷偷摸鱼中喵～ <br />要不要回首页逛逛，也许会有意外收获？(・ω・)ノ
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
